  "body": "While writing https://github.com/matrix-org/complement/pull/459, it was noticed that Synapse would sometimes emit an unnecessary `device_lists.changed` entry in the next sync after retrieving the device list for a remote user.\r\n\r\nWhile it doesn't contravene the spirit of the spec, it's inefficient as well-behaved clients will ask the homeserver for device keys a second time.",
